From a3a1666f3a7a3dcd9b26ee2757e7a3291a713609 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openrazer-win contributor <contributor@localhost>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:01:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Studio: remember when each device was last charged

Studio records, per device, the highest charge of its last charge and
the day (local time), in settings.json: a charge is seen when the device
reports charging or reads at least 3 points above its lowest since the
last charge; a charge to less than full counts and the next replaces
it. The device page's Battery panel shows "Last charged to 98% on
25 Nov 2026", also while the device reports no level.
---
